{"componentChunkName":"component---src-pages-new-projects-js","path":"new-projects/in-mira-villas","result":{"serverData":{"data":{"status":true,"hits":[{"rank":null,"slug":"mira-villas-mira-developments-meydan","about":"Experience the elegance of Mira Villas, the first branded villa community by Bentley Home, featuring 36 exclusive units, including luxurious 5-bedroom villas and mansions. This unique residential offering brings the exquisite craftsmanship of the renowned British automotive legend into the realm of Italian interior design. The collaboration with Luxury Living Group and Bentley Home ensures a blend of exceptional design and superior craftsmanship in the Bentley Villas Dubai.Each villa at Mira Villas, designed by Bentley Home, is available in one of three interior styles, catering to your individual preferences. Nestled in the prestigious District 11 Meydan Bentley Villas, Mira Villas promises an opulent lifestyle with meticulously crafted residences that embody sophistication and comfort. The partnership with Luxury Living Group and Bentley Home ensures that each villa is a true masterpiece, showcasing exquisite design and meticulous attention to detail.Discover the Bentley Villas Dubai location, where luxury knows no bounds, and every aspect reflects MIRA Developments' dedication to creating exceptional living spaces. Mira Villas redefine opulent living in Meydan, setting new benchmarks for premium, bespoke homes. Welcome to a lifestyle where luxury is not just a feature but a way of life, with Bentley Villas Dubai amenities and features that are unparalleled.","price":24800000,"title":"Mira Villas","bitrix":{"id":755,"pf_id":"are.2.13723","source":null,"project_id":"Mira Villas","tower_name":null,"campaign_name":"Mira Villas","property_type":"Villas","developer_name":"Mira Development","project_location":"Meydan"},"images":[{"340x252":"https://d3h330vgpwpjr8.cloudfront.net/x/340x252/Mira_Villas_by_Bentley_Home_Villas_Dubai_in_District_11_MBR_City_e